.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-list 1  "list " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-list \- List drafts, snapshots, messages, or addresses to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc list\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
List drafts, snapshots, messages, or addresses to stdout
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mdmc\-list\-drafts(1)
List draft file paths
.TP
mdmc\-list\-snapshots(1)
List snapshot file paths
.TP
mdmc\-list\-msgs(1)
List message\-ids
.TP
mdmc\-list\-addr(1)
List addresses
